{
    "title": "Bingo Wild - Animal BINGO Game",
    "description": "Hey, friends of bingo games! Here is a brand new and <b>free bingo game</b>-Bingo Wild! \r\nFree online, bingo competition at blitz speed, and win huge free bingo bonus as rewards, Bingo Wild is a casual bingo game without gambling real money, just for fun! Enjoy playing bingo games with friends and families, and rank top in different classic and featured bingo games.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf81 <b>Free Bingo Bonus</b>\r\nDaily Bonus: free bingo coins and free powerups everyday in Bingo Wild;\r\nLucky Scratch: 4 times a day and win up to 10k+ bingo coins for free;\r\nQuickTap Lotto: win up to 10k+ bingo coins. \r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd29 <b>Royal League</b>\r\nYou can join in real-time bingo tournaments with bingo players around the world. There is the bingo rank after each bingo tournament. There will be more bingo rewards as players climb to the top of the bingo leaderboards. Download and compete in the free bingo games.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc1f <b>Wild Gallery</b>\r\nIts\u2019 the photo collection after bingo games. Players can get 3 types of photos after bingo games. Playing bingo games, get photos and complete the bingo gallery to win huge prize for free. There are also free mini spin games to win free bingo bonus. \r\n\r\n\u2b50 <b>Bingo Themes</b>\r\nBesides the classic bingo themes, Bingo Wild has the special bingo themes, and all the special bingo themes are free to play! In each theme room, players can choose to play up to 4 bingo cards. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc3 <b>Bingo Task</b>\r\nDaily Task: There are common daily tasks and wild tasks. Before playing bingo games, read and complete it to win free bingo rewards like bingo coins, hammers and bingo boosters.\r\nEgg Smash: Smash your silver and gold eggs to win free bingo rewards in the mini bingo games.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89 <b>Bingo Jigsaw Puzzle</b>\r\nIn each bingo room, players can win free puzzle pieces of Bingo Wild. If you are also a fan of jigsaw games, don\u2019t miss this free bingo games. Play bingo games in each bingo room to collect free pieces and complete it to win free bingo bonus. Enjoy yourself in the free bingo games.\r\n\r\nBingo games belongs to board games, card games, casino games, or casual games. Bingo Wild is a free bingo games to play. It makes you play free bingo games at home. With both classic 75-ball bingo games and special pop bingo games, just enjoy yourself in the free bingo games-Bingo Wild!\r\n\r\n<b>Please note</b>:\r\nAn internet connection is required when play Bingo Wild for it's the free bingo games online.\r\nBingo Wild is a free bingo games to play, but you can make in-app purchases with real money.\r\nBingo Wild does not offer 'real money gambling' or an opportunity to win real money or prizes.",
